### 18\. Recommended learning order

* Snort installation and configuration.

* Rule structure and actions.

* IP addresses, ports and protocols.

* Content matching.

* HTTP and DNS detection.

* TCP flags and flow tracking.

* Detection filters and alert management.

* Writing custom IDS rules.

* Analysing alerts alongside Wireshark.

* Configuring IPS mode safely.

If you master these areas, you will have a strong foundation in Snort rule writing and network intrusion detection.

